        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If Haduvio is approved for the treatment of patients with RCC, we expect that it may compete with product candidates in clinical development for the treatment of patients with RCC such as camlipixant, a P2X3 antagonist, which is being developed by GSK plc.",
